Z||000012||lowCG||03-14-2001||11:38 PM||||That rear toe is off;should be pretty close from side to side also.additionally the caster should be between 5 and 7,(4 isn't enough).<BR>What are your tire sizes/pressures?<BR>Rear toe is 1/8" total,front is 1/16.<BR>In degrees,I believe it's around .1 per side for the rear.<BR>Good luck.||||reg||1
